  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_7319.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La dise&ntilde;adora argentina afincada en Onda, Carol Ohcean (a la izquierda de la foto, con gafas), es la ganadora del concurso de logotipos del caf&eacute; rock&nbsp;La Oveja Negra de Onda. Se hab&iacute;an presentado veinte trabajos y tambi&eacute;n han sido finalistas Manolo Aguilella y Rebeca Brun Santiago, tambi&eacute;n de Onda, y Llu&iacute;s Chesa, de Vila-real.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/noulogolaovejanegraonda/img_7305.jpg\" alt=\"img_7305\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/noulogolaovejanegraonda/img_7306.jpg\" alt=\"img_7306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/noulogolaovejanegraonda/img_7307.jpg\" alt=\"img_7307\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/noulogolaovejanegraonda/img_7308.jpg\" alt=\"img_7308\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/noulogolaovejanegraonda/img_7309.jpg\" alt=\"img_7309\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/noulogolaovejanegraonda/img_7310.jpg\" alt=\"img_7310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/noulogolaovejanegraonda/img_7311.jpg\" alt=\"img_7311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/noulogolaovejanegraonda/img_7312.jpg\" alt=\"img_7312\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/noulogolaovejanegraonda/img_7313.jpg